  "text" : "<p c-createcomplaintlwc_createcomplaintlwc=\"\">ANZ supports your decision to remain anonymous and appreciates your feedback.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p c-createcomplaintlwc_createcomplaintlwc=\"\">Complaints made anonymously or using a pseudonym may limit our ability to manage some complaints effectively and may mean we can only provide a generic response.</p>",
